@tunnckoCore - FYI, I don't see Prosperity 2.0.0 as submitted to be added. Someone has to submit it first, then the SPDX legal team has to review it, and then there is a fair amount of work to actually get the license on the list in the right format for the next SPDX License List release. See: https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md
There is a very small number of volunteers who do this work. We'd be happy to have more help and feedback on how to communicate this reality more broadly! (preferably, via our mailing list)
thanks.
